---
// src/pages/privacy.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Turtle Transformation Limited"
  description="GDPR-compliant data protection and privacy policy for Turtle Transformation Limited."
>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-sand-50">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="border-b border-sand-300 pb-8 mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-turtle-600">Data Protection</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mt-1">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-sand-600 mt-2">Information on how personal data is processed in accordance with the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-turtle max-w-none space-y-8 text-sand-800 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">1. Controller Information</h2>
          <p>
            The data controller within the meaning of the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is:<br><br>
            <strong>Turtle Transformation Limited</strong><br>
            Drom Upper, Glenbeigh, Co. Kerry, V93 F6X0, Ireland<br>
            Email: <a href="mailto:info@turtletrafo.de" class="text-turtle-800 underline">info@turtletrafo.de</a><br>
            Phone: +353 87 227 5723
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">2. Overview of Data Processing</h2>
          <p>
            We process personal data only to the extent necessary to provide a functional, high-performance website and to respond to your inquiries regarding our coaching and consulting services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">3. Hosting on GitHub Pages</h2>
          <p>
            This website is statically hosted on GitHub Pages, a service provided by GitHub, Inc. (88 Colin P Kelly Jr St, San Francisco, CA 94107, USA). When you visit our website, GitHub may collect server log files, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, and timestamp of access. This processing is based on our legitimate interest in the secure and efficient provision of our website pursuant to Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">4. Direct Inquiries via Email</h2>
          <p>
            When you contact us via email (<a href="mailto:info@turtletrafo.de" class="text-turtle-800 underline">info@turtletrafo.de</a>), your email address, name, and the details provided in your message are processed and stored solely for the purpose of handling your consultation inquiry and potential contract formation (Art. 6(1)(b) and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). We do not share your contact information with third parties without your explicit consent.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">5. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
          <p>
            Our website is intentionally lightweight and privacy-respecting. We do not use third-party behavioral tracking cookies, advertising pixels, or invasive telemetry scripts.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">6. Your Rights Under GDPR</h2>
          <p>
            Under the GDPR, you have the following rights regarding your personal data:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-sand-700 mt-2">
            <li>Right of access (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
            <li>Right to rectification (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
            <li>Right to erasure / "Right to be forgotten" (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
            <li>Right to restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
            <li>Right to data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
            <li>Right to object (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To exercise any of these rights, simply email us at <a href="mailto:info@turtletrafo.de" class="text-turtle-800 underline">info@turtletrafo.de</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Irish Data Protection Commission (DPC) or your competent supervisory authority.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-turtle-950 mb-2">7. Updates to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect operational or regulatory changes. The latest version will always be accessible on this page.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs text-sand-500 mt-2">Last updated: October 2026</p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

